@WebApplication.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5191

### Seed Products
POST {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/products/seed
Accept: application/json

### Search Products
GET {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/products/search?q=wireless audio
Accept: application/json

### Hybrid Search Products
GET {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/products/hybrid-search?q=wireless audio
Accept: application/json

